  "project_description": "Add Group support for Entity Reference Hierarchy.\n\n Features \n Adds support for group module to Entity Reference Hierarchy.\n\n- Adds option to restrict the selection of parent entities to the current group context.\n\n- Adds option to restrict selection of parent entities outside of group context if not in group context.\n\n- Adds option to only allow one similar hierarchy for each group.\n\n Post-Installation \n Adjust Entity hierarchy group settings. \n\n Additional Requirements \n Requires Group 3.x and Entity Reference Hierarchy 5.x\n\n Back to top",
